;Hand-written LinuxCNC tool table for the CAM-052 import test
T1   P1   D+0.250000 Z+1.250000 ;1/4 flat end mill
t2	p2	d0.125 z-0.5   ;  1/8 flat end mill
T3 P3 Z+1.0 ;no diameter
T4 P4 D0.5 X0.1 Y0 A0 B0 C0 U0 V0 W0 I0 J0 Q0
T1 P5 D0.375 ;repeated number
T6 P6 D0 ;zero diameter
T7 P7 Dabc ;bad diameter
T8 P8 D0.2 K5 ;unknown word
T-9 P9 D0.1 ;negative number
P10 D0.1 ;no number

; closing remark
